Cell["Series expansion around the origin (x,w)\[Rule](0,0)", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"08579370-b91b-4a59-bfb0-36a52752abe4"],

Cell["\<\
H topology, 3-loop 1-mass, y=w x change of variables. This notebook builds \
the letter series, the atilde matrix, and the weight-by-weight reconstruction \
of J(x,w). See matrix_exp/ for the companion Exp[eps Log] matrix machinery \
and matrix_exp/regularization_writeup.pdf for the underlying derivation.\
\>", "Subtitle",ExpressionUUID->"6344bd9c-a0b8-4a7a-b7f8-06873c79fd47"],

